# /prd-portfolio (Cursor)

List in-flight and parked PRDs (Draft/Proposed, specs/runs that are idle, open docs PRs that add PRDs not yet on the default branch). Follow Mode B of the `sdlc-prd-progress` skill (`.cursor/skills/sdlc-prd-progress/SKILL.md`) and run `scripts/prd-portfolio.sh`.